  "body": "When using canvas' [context.filter](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#filters) with a [`drop-shadow()`](https://drafts.fxtf.org/filter-effects/#funcdef-filter-drop-shadow) filter primitive that uses `currentcolor` as the color parameter, for example:\r\n\r\n```\r\n   context.filter = \"drop-shadow(30px 10px 4px currentcolor)\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nit is not clear in the spec when currentcolor should be resolved or under what rules. Should it be resolved at parse time, like font relative lengths, or at draw time, like referenced SVG filters?    ",
